+
+### Before deploying — the database harness
+
+`npm test` runs 150 tests. 97 of them execute real SQL against real PostgreSQL
+18.3 (PGlite, in-process), built by `tests/harness.ts`. The harness reconstructs
+a Supabase-shaped environment — the `anon`, `authenticated` and `service_role`
+roles, `auth.uid()`, the `storage` schema — lays down the base schema, then
