+| `tests/migrations.integrity.test.ts` | Phase 2. Idempotency (the whole set applied twice, no duplicate policies), per-table grants for `authenticated` and `service_role`, `anon` denial, `app_secrets` ungranted, sequence privileges, every `SECURITY DEFINER` function pinning `search_path` **and** `pg_temp`, expiry predicates agreeing across an owner/viewer matrix, the CHECK constraints, the permitted TTL values, Realtime publication membership, `REPLICA IDENTITY FULL`, foreign-key delete rules, index coverage, and file hygiene. Also executes `docs/PREFLIGHT.sql` in full and verifies it changes nothing. |
+| `tests/webpush.crypto.test.ts` | Phase 12. The push delivery path: the VAPID key envelope is accepted by Web Crypto, the signed JWT verifies against its public key, and a full RFC 8291 encrypt/decrypt round trip with a decryptor written independently from the specification. |
